# Fabric Workspace User Management
# Requires VS Code REST Client extension
#
# 1. Get token first:
#    az account get-access-token --resource https://analysis.windows.net/powerbi/api --query accessToken -o tsv
# 2. Paste token into @token below
# 3. Get workspace ID from Fabric portal URL:
#    https://app.fabric.microsoft.com/groups/<workspace-id>/...
# 4. Paste workspace ID into @workspaceId below

@baseUrl     = https://api.powerbi.com/v1.0/myorg
@workspaceId = <workspace-id>
@principalId = <managed-identity-principal-id>
@token       = <access-token>

### List current workspace members (verify before/after)
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{workspaceId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add DAB managed identity as workspace Member
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{workspaceId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "groupUserAccessRight": "Member",
    "identifier": "{{principalId}}",
    "principalType": "App"
}

###

### Update role (if already added, change role)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{workspaceId}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "groupUserAccessRight": "Member",
    "identifier": "{{principalId}}",
    "principalType": "App"
}

###

### Remove managed identity from workspace (cleanup)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{workspaceId}}/users/{{principalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
